<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;">We're not going to list <%= @inquiry.service_name %>.</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">
  <% if @inquiry.review_notes.present? %>
    <%= @inquiry.review_notes %>
  <% else %>
    It isn't a fit for the catalog as it stands today. That's a judgement call about the
    catalog, not about your work.
  <% end %>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">
  If something changes — a different price, a different endpoint, a use case you think we've
  misread — reply to this email and we'll look again. Nothing about this decision is permanent.
</p>

<p style="margin:0;color:#666666;font-size:13px;">
  You submitted <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace"><%= @inquiry.upstream_url %></span> at <%= usdc(@inquiry.price_atomic) %> USDC per call. Nothing was listed and nothing was charged.
</p>
